    rdfs:label "domatium"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A cardinal organ part (PO:0025001) of a vascular leaf (PO:0009025) that is a small cavity, pocket or tuft of trichomes, typically in the axil of a leaf vein on the abaxial surface, inhabited by mites or other small arthropods."@en ;
